<title>USA: LPC-Leading lenders to U.S. commercial borrowers.</title>
<headline>LPC-Leading lenders to U.S. commercial borrowers.</headline>
<text>
<p>LPC - US lending league tables for commercial loans, agent/co-agent</p>
<p>NEW YORK, Aug 27 (LPC) - The leading issuers of commercial syndicated loans to U.S. borrowers, as compiled by Loan Pricing Corp.</p>
<p>Each lender with an agent or co-agent title on a deal receives full credit for the transaction. Table is for 1996-to-date, ending August 27.</p>
